  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "早晨一起來我就曉得我是住在湖邊上了。",
      "output_sha256": "534c7260c724fd1d654df6a912b98be314be093ecdc85cfa81332272d2bd390c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "534c7260c724fd1d654df6a912b98be314be093ecdc85cfa81332272d2bd390c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "對於這場雨中的湖，雖然我尚感陌生，但卻不似南方的朋友們北上時，對北方的風沙、乾燥空氣及廣袤大地所產生的那般深切的厭惡與恐懼。",
      "output_sha256": "44cdb8d3b4874204690e97ef216d77f8c271b1c1549984ea27028bd236ed4378",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.519305,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0fe1cdad388f6b5ecbb8a6abc9e42258f795b0193bc7f9b6fae584ac1b2bbcc0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "44cdb8d3b4874204690e97ef216d77f8c271b1c1549984ea27028bd236ed4378",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "正因為這種厭惡與恐懼，他們對北方的讚美反而愈發強烈。",
      "output_sha256": "7186a070293ac467c1d761c2fc1acfc4972de3b21cdb0d18cc47d3b705ef4b6d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.478333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "99ff816c80cbd39044a115b4cd43849065e747a21bc82d6550b37dc8371c96b1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7186a070293ac467c1d761c2fc1acfc4972de3b21cdb0d18cc47d3b705ef4b6d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "當沙土侵擾了他們的視線時，他們驚呼：“偉大的風沙啊！”",
      "output_sha256": "aba982bb07269d02aeeb4532fced17765285156e8d3cd93afb89e37a9c8ee1d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.619863,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9f91219e5bc0ba0986e19d02e8fee2994f797b25b00048b783043f752f2aa7e3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "aba982bb07269d02aeeb4532fced17765285156e8d3cd93afb89e37a9c8ee1d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "黃河地帶的土層遮漫了他們的視野的時候，他們說那是無邊的使他們不能相信那也是大地。",
      "output_sha256": "5cf70bca5dd5f1f15f41f7067529357f13c3e3642bef87d105ee8778e7563395",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "5cf70bca5dd5f1f15f41f7067529357f13c3e3642bef87d105ee8778e7563395",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "迎着風走去，大風塞住他們的呼吸的時候，他們說：“這……這……這……”他們說不出來了，北方對於他們的謳歌也偉大到不能夠容許了。",
      "output_sha256": "a81036d4f8462503a81109a2e0e3c156fa031e9a5a4d9a0114a359e35c5b129b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "a81036d4f8462503a81109a2e0e3c156fa031e9a5a4d9a0114a359e35c5b129b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "但當風一停，他們的眼睛能夠睜開時，觀察依舊，言語也隨之而來。",
      "output_sha256": "50411a8290c1cd1f9a3959d19ad5d0bb1f13c04319bc5de9032963bbd36da0d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.516802,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a2954acdacbb02a802a7279407e5010ecb0d52f470a9ce84f762564f3dbd3c56"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "50411a8290c1cd1f9a3959d19ad5d0bb1f13c04319bc5de9032963bbd36da0d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有一次，我突然感受到了一種被侮辱的感覺，那位一路上對風沙讚美不已的朋友，邊擦拭著被沙塵刺痛的眼睛，一邊問我：“你們家鄉那邊常年如此嗎？”",
      "output_sha256": "266948029d68fc525af0768cbc85b1d8ef7186fe0aabc4b40eafe8f8238bf065",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.603908,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8,
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a262629bc5c367a207633068541620bf17d7666d02e7554dd98abbd2f1bcd161",
        "b5d73e891c3d542cc50ef905b25dcc53806c3c1a9f8d7420672cad1fdd5f1f76"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "266948029d68fc525af0768cbc85b1d8ef7186fe0aabc4b40eafe8f8238bf065",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“那裏！",
      "output_sha256": "604932dc431c6e6e7847f24effd1ba77fc8fe59669ed9bb9a9c149f785237eb7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "604932dc431c6e6e7847f24effd1ba77fc8fe59669ed9bb9a9c149f785237eb7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那裏！",
      "output_sha256": "9357b7531715ef683e8d592163c8c5153716b41109f22554a469a389ddd0b6f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "9357b7531715ef683e8d592163c8c5153716b41109f22554a469a389ddd0b6f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我們那邊冬天是白雪，夏天是雲、雨、藍天和綠樹……只是春天有幾次大風，因爲大風是季節的症候，所以人們也愛它。”",
      "output_sha256": "aa0d362738584b3ec2ff3d26e2144eb15b7e885cbad763fb448e46653be4f146",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "aa0d362738584b3ec2ff3d26e2144eb15b7e885cbad763fb448e46653be4f146",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是往山西去的路上，我就指着火車外邊所有的黃土層：“在我們家鄉那邊都是平原，夏天是青的，冬天是白的，春天大地被太陽蒸發着，好像冒煙一樣從冬天活過來了，而秋天收割。”",
      "output_sha256": "320d23909ce1e52d2091001c2634243d4850f87ffeec0010d2a37f9d7ffbf0a3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "320d23909ce1e52d2091001c2634243d4850f87ffeec0010d2a37f9d7ffbf0a3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而我看他似乎不很注意聽的樣子。",
      "output_sha256": "77b8d8214efe2f362afa0364999af17022b0fd2cdc3b79a91d652b6d868fa148",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "77b8d8214efe2f362afa0364999af17022b0fd2cdc3b79a91d652b6d868fa148",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“東北還有不被採伐的煤礦，還有大森林……所以日本人……”",
      "output_sha256": "dbdc705564d0d8e9e30e68036e9c5183620d7cf4ab4ea26f2085023373bf0b22",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "dbdc705564d0d8e9e30e68036e9c5183620d7cf4ab4ea26f2085023373bf0b22",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“唔！",
      "output_sha256": "194b8d87cce64a0059bd1929d9719fe866c759b270c84d3b4669cd7dbe7b79e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "194b8d87cce64a0059bd1929d9719fe866c759b270c84d3b4669cd7dbe7b79e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "唔！”",
      "output_sha256": "0ca8af7b0d43fa6d8eb19225501c34034613753bd57ef3b731d4a973342984bf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "0ca8af7b0d43fa6d8eb19225501c34034613753bd57ef3b731d4a973342984bf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他完全沒有注意聽，他的拜佩完全是對着風沙和黃土。",
      "output_sha256": "9a83b554afbd179807640e140cec4c02cd5d9213a4d8c1ea58d163c76e9fc0c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "9a83b554afbd179807640e140cec4c02cd5d9213a4d8c1ea58d163c76e9fc0c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想這對於北方的謳歌就像對於原始的大獸的謳歌一樣。",
      "output_sha256": "a1f98b62a33ede42352fcfe1e3fe3b45aa35fe38ea4aba8daa21b557fa034168",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "a1f98b62a33ede42352fcfe1e3fe3b45aa35fe38ea4aba8daa21b557fa034168",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在西安和八路軍殘廢兵是同院住着，所以朝夕所看到的都是他們。",
      "output_sha256": "d4d3d17d8d3f4527d6f5fc45efc208049715df4b5f594538a082286db6896e10",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "d4d3d17d8d3f4527d6f5fc45efc208049715df4b5f594538a082286db6896e10",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有一天我看到一個殘廢的女兵，我就向別人問：“也是戰鬥員嗎？”",
      "output_sha256": "a939a776aad3d01f42b7cf85c941213604927c983cc920e51c5e66f8092fe352",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "a939a776aad3d01f42b7cf85c941213604927c983cc920e51c5e66f8092fe352",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那人回答得模糊不清，可能是戰鬥員，也可能是女救護員。",
      "output_sha256": "3e12eef7445c39d7a1105e5db1d48b596ab8f6cb6f156995c831bc050a68c7a8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.472061,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "483ea04700d3773a67eb5d994d5ae49ff22c32485544ba462597384db200aff5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3e12eef7445c39d7a1105e5db1d48b596ab8f6cb6f156995c831bc050a68c7a8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "當我再次看到她，一隻手杵著兩根木棍，另一隻手擺動著一隻空褲管的時候，她卻被一堵牆遮住，留給我的只有那兩根每一步都讓她肩頭不安的白色木棍。",
      "output_sha256": "98022868fe7c332ace90e60cb1be2aa54135101246f32f9ebc4a585f03f465aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.498968,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cf4ba22eba640801fc89ac119d71b03843db75bd5f29ec098fe979b804c8ce01"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "98022868fe7c332ace90e60cb1be2aa54135101246f32f9ebc4a585f03f465aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我面向着日本帝國主義，我要謳歌了！",
      "output_sha256": "99503f8dcf76f662211ac40ab4bceceeb2f6163fa7e1b3ee067ead614045a5fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "99503f8dcf76f662211ac40ab4bceceeb2f6163fa7e1b3ee067ead614045a5fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "就像南方的朋友們在北方看到那終年行走於風沙中的瘦驢子，出於同情而想要讚美她。",
      "output_sha256": "cca5726ebcaab83a71a61c45bb6212c1c8efdba6940acb88065ae444544a151b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.634587,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2404f263e81fb47dabbb53898aa81e1a43ed3d30b54c8815b9ded3f3f5327305"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cca5726ebcaab83a71a61c45bb6212c1c8efdba6940acb88065ae444544a151b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但這只是一刻的心情，對於野蠻的東西所遺留下來的痕跡，憎惡在我是會破壞了我的藝術的心意的。",
      "output_sha256": "0dae7cd166b3ff6c69c3ab3bf9b1b9c3bdcc31f1b1de62084d048a92abcf905e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "0dae7cd166b3ff6c69c3ab3bf9b1b9c3bdcc31f1b1de62084d048a92abcf905e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那女兵將來也要做母親的，孩子若問她：“媽媽爲什麼你少了一條腿呢？”",
      "output_sha256": "0a2d567657dbefdef46e10861a31c832c4432d4619db0228f177ea2cb6922b01",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "0a2d567657dbefdef46e10861a31c832c4432d4619db0228f177ea2cb6922b01",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "她的回答會是日本帝國主義所造成的。",
      "output_sha256": "623d62eba99b48fc29a625142e2bfc6664967c3aed6c63aed71bf2b7ab320659",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.598277,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f01a040a801a6da72820295bd0436f6943cf48e257bc48c29beadcfb2f4119ff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "623d62eba99b48fc29a625142e2bfc6664967c3aed6c63aed71bf2b7ab320659",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "成爲一個母親，當孩子指問到她的殘缺點的時候，無管這殘缺是光榮過，還是恥辱過，對於做母親的都一齊會成爲灼傷的。",
      "output_sha256": "e2b02cc7c9e3c76c1a336d6a710c068e547e28cfffd22efbd1349768973b0fae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "e2b02cc7c9e3c76c1a336d6a710c068e547e28cfffd22efbd1349768973b0fae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "受到合理性影響的事物，人們認為是無力量的——弱的——或者被稱為生命力已受損的事物——所謂生命力不強的——就像屠格涅夫在文人中，大家提起他時：好是好，但……卻又如何呢？",
      "output_sha256": "037113e33a00a9fae5199bea7694ace72bcac664678d6c89c97ffe74d8ee6e65",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.581102,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f0c4e854fc45738e303db40f250515aff45dae59c9114c1bb09ee24315d7bf85"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "037113e33a00a9fae5199bea7694ace72bcac664678d6c89c97ffe74d8ee6e65",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我就看到過很多對屠格涅夫搖頭的人，這搖頭是爲什麼呢？",
      "output_sha256": "80d24e481ff629421ff78b0884c41c9d171a6e6cb1bcdbb21d33887005e58eb9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "80d24e481ff629421ff78b0884c41c9d171a6e6cb1bcdbb21d33887005e58eb9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不能無所因。",
      "output_sha256": "09f95d975a94a0042b4f5a319158bad365351174360c38e1910270d80827761b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "09f95d975a94a0042b4f5a319158bad365351174360c38e1910270d80827761b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "久了，同時也因爲我對搖頭的人過於琢磨的緣故，默默之中感到了，並且在我的靈感達到最高潮的時候，也就無恐懼起來，我就替搖頭者們嚷着說：“他的生命力不強！”",
      "output_sha256": "87985b7d2e7b98971200061d5e8506ef33e1db16b7f28285ccdfb0cf3d1c0570",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "87985b7d2e7b98971200061d5e8506ef33e1db16b7f28285ccdfb0cf3d1c0570",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "屠格涅夫是合理的、美麗的、寧靜的，他從靈魂走向本能的作家。",
      "output_sha256": "aa653b0ec36504fb988d31402708ae7db11ddc6c3065b8dba0cc8b0322275226",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.693771,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dfe0d5892190145cab696b372afd90a071d2c99a04860eb7601b6611db2fdd99"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "aa653b0ec36504fb988d31402708ae7db11ddc6c3065b8dba0cc8b0322275226",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "和他走同一道路的，還有法國的羅曼·羅蘭。",
      "output_sha256": "6caa67c957e88ded668c1cf964e5edfc4b8b4f6586fd3d107b5638eaca494f41",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "6caa67c957e88ded668c1cf964e5edfc4b8b4f6586fd3d107b5638eaca494f41",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "別的作家們他們則不同，他們暴亂、邪狂、破碎，他們是先從本能出發——或者一切從本能出發——而後走到靈魂。",
      "output_sha256": "59a5f76d39576201a93f1efd43b9350081123475ea9a7f03ae31e4ff0dda0d64",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "59a5f76d39576201a93f1efd43b9350081123475ea9a7f03ae31e4ff0dda0d64",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有慢慢走到靈魂的，也有永久走不到靈魂的，那永久走不到靈魂的，他就永久站在他的本能上喊着：“我的生命力強啊！",
      "output_sha256": "ddf7d7b40fc1c2b6e78597821cb159fc497bf7005e54f1c4346f79295bfc99f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "ddf7d7b40fc1c2b6e78597821cb159fc497bf7005e54f1c4346f79295bfc99f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的生命力強啊！”",
      "output_sha256": "a452a9bab1caab0f21ad631023aa89786411c9fc270e72e4af52e055e167fd3e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "a452a9bab1caab0f21ad631023aa89786411c9fc270e72e4af52e055e167fd3e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但不要聽錯了，這可並不是他自己對自己的惋惜，一方面是在驕傲着生命力弱的，另一面是在招呼那些尚在向靈魂出發的在半途上感到吃力，正停在樹下冒汗的朋友們。",
      "output_sha256": "1a835f6f9273b0008ed195b3454a6b7524c7da022b1b983d043ad18b18cd08de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "1a835f6f9273b0008ed195b3454a6b7524c7da022b1b983d043ad18b18cd08de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "聽他這一招呼，可見生命力強的也是孤獨的。",
      "output_sha256": "49b92c224190fc63d7cdc2e9227635814c62997ad12033c0d5fe91af91778e51",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "49b92c224190fc63d7cdc2e9227635814c62997ad12033c0d5fe91af91778e51",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "於是我這佩服之感也就不完整了。",
      "output_sha256": "d367d911349090f2c4cd02ce4b7b777b82d6f9e3ad5491e713dd69e6353a05f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "d367d911349090f2c4cd02ce4b7b777b82d6f9e3ad5491e713dd69e6353a05f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我所見到的生命力最為強大的是日本帝國主義。",
      "output_sha256": "1f99d86353777c175fc7fc336341fd650a1e9b722805a610d07ed2c1cc0fa74b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.684722,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "de4b76ce642ccd14a5c7bc780134236c570915e6ea1d4d84bb39682fc865aec6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1f99d86353777c175fc7fc336341fd650a1e9b722805a610d07ed2c1cc0fa74b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "人們都說日本帝國主義野蠻、如獸、如爬蟲，毫無血肉之軀，完全是荒唐的存在！",
      "output_sha256": "ce2ea360ba3872cc19a0edf69ecafbed42e8e6bc1df425446b0c859bd5e1b070",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.546066,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43,
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5f7605031a46d4279e56027252505df81ddda9d45a3f91447e62793b813e4cd2",
        "d92549a87a0e04e6877b53e926bf3595bb4e35c53863a3d7bbb9d98b463704d5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ce2ea360ba3872cc19a0edf69ecafbed42e8e6bc1df425446b0c859bd5e1b070",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因此，南方的風景，似乎比北方的風沙來得愉悅。",
      "output_sha256": "6f100379a47eac963b2b9e18ec59f91e03c72ed1ff733dec80fe2d17ff25a560",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.55373,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ddbe8e35f9956cb554819782fed15e55ed8a9341927e9170d07b5ea1eee419be"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6f100379a47eac963b2b9e18ec59f91e03c72ed1ff733dec80fe2d17ff25a560",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至於那位南方的朋友對北方的讚美，我並非在諷刺他。",
      "output_sha256": "898ed0e7a9fc75b35e00391d429e5f76eabe1a6a840cfbbcaf37fe0b716b2961",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.615127,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "58d6e4698137d2d33fcbe7e69ad50a35a67e68a50e5f6fd42e084d05cb7d08a0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "898ed0e7a9fc75b35e00391d429e5f76eabe1a6a840cfbbcaf37fe0b716b2961",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "去把捉完全隔離的東西，不管誰，大概都被嚇住的。",
      "output_sha256": "4b6c27e4c7f185f12999a595c6e0bf3b51f29b49e6c3a7c584306a455639ae75",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "4b6c27e4c7f185f12999a595c6e0bf3b51f29b49e6c3a7c584306a455639ae75",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我對於南方的鑑賞，因爲我已經住了幾年的緣故，初來到南方也是不可能。",
      "output_sha256": "94e1c42d4fb377b9d4442d359181250d31de313c16623fc96f85e85c2a3a2d4a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
